title: "hrc-voice-gate: Safety-gated natural-language preferences for human-robot collaborative kitting"
abstract: "Code, RoboDK cell, bilingual benchmark and results for a safety-gated architecture in which a local language model proposes operator preferences in a typed constraint language and a deterministic admission gate is the only path to the scheduler."
